TITLE Mix 50 mmol/kg DIC with 50 mmol/kg Ca (1:1) and heat 20 to 200 C, allow calcite equil

SOLUTION 1 DIC
    temp 20
    units mmol/kgw
    pH 7 charge
    C(4) 50 as HCO3

SOLUTION 2 Ca
    temp 20
    units mmol/kgw
    pH 7 charge
    Ca 50

MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0

REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 40 60 80 100 120 140 160 180 200

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file mix_heat_calcite.sel
    -reset false
    -temperature true
    -totals Ca C(4)
    -molalities Ca+2 CaHCO3+ CaCO3 CaOH+ CaH2CO3+ CaH3CO3+2

END
